### Xatlov API — 1-bosqich (Davlat muassasalari ro'yxati)
### VS Code "REST Client" yoki JetBrains HTTP Client bilan ishlaydi

@base = http://localhost:3000
@auth = Basic eGF0bG92OmNoYW5nZS1tZQ==
# ^ base64("xatlov:change-me") — BASIC_USER/BASIC_PASS o'zgarsa qayta hisoblang

### Holat (auth talab qilinmaydi)
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Ro'yxat: filtr + sahifalash
GET {{base}}/api/organisations?page=1&limit=20&q=hokimligi&state=1&sort=updated_at&order=desc
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Bitta tashkilot (id bo'yicha)
GET {{base}}/api/organisations/1
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Bitta tashkilot (STIR bo'yicha)
GET {{base}}/api/organisations/by-tin/201122334
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Qo'shish (STIR mavjud bo'lsa — yangilanadi)
POST {{base}}/api/organisations
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeid": 1,
  "source_id": "DM-001",
  "org_name": "Toshkent shahar hokimligi",
  "region_id": 26,
  "district_id": 263,
  "tin": "201122334",
  "state": 1,
  "soato": "1726269"
}

### Qat'iy qo'shish: dublikat bo'lsa 409 qaytadi
POST {{base}}/api/organisations?mode=insert
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "org_name": "Yangi tashkilot", "tin": "111222333" }

### Qisman yangilash (id bo'yicha)
PATCH {{base}}/api/organisations/1
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "org_name": "Toshkent shahar hokimligi apparati", "state": 1 }

### To'liq yangilash (id bo'yicha)
PUT {{base}}/api/organisations/1
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeid": 1,
  "source_id": "DM-001",
  "org_name": "Toshkent shahar hokimligi",
  "region_id": 26,
  "district_id": 263,
  "tin": "201122334",
  "state": 1,
  "soato": "1726269"
}

### STIR bo'yicha upsert — manba tizimi uchun asosiy nuqta
PUT {{base}}/api/organisations/by-tin/201122334
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeid": 1,
  "source_id": "DM-001",
  "org_name": "Toshkent shahar hokimligi",
  "region_id": 26,
  "district_id": 263,
  "soato": "1726269"
}

### STIR bo'yicha qisman yangilash
PATCH {{base}}/api/organisations/by-tin/201122334
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "state": 0 }

### Nofaol qilish (yozuv o'chirilmaydi, state = 0)
DELETE {{base}}/api/organisations/1
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Ommaviy yuklash (asosiy import nuqtasi)
POST {{base}}/api/organisations/bulk
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "davlat-mulki",
  "items": [
    {
      "typeid": 1,
      "source_id": "DM-001",
      "org_name": "Toshkent shahar hokimligi",
      "region_id": 26,
      "district_id": 263,
      "tin": "201122334",
      "soato": "1726269"
    },
    {
      "typeid": 2,
      "source_id": "DM-002",
      "org_name": "Chilonzor tumani hokimligi",
      "region_id": 26,
      "district_id": 264,
      "tin": "302233445",
      "soato": "1726262"
    }
  ]
}

### Yuklash sessiyalari tarixi
GET {{base}}/api/sync-runs?limit=20
Authorization: {{auth}}
